title: POST /repos/:repo/reconcile
tags: [[HTTP endpoint]] [[Running a reconcile]]
kind: reference
audience: dev
summary: Starts a full or scoped reconcile as a task.

The body is optional, every key too:

|!Key |!Default |!Does |
|`metarecord` |— |32-hex: reconcile only the subtree of that metarecord |
|`threshold` |— |the similarity phase's minimum score, in [0, 1]; absent, no similarity phase |
|`mime` |`true` |compute `mfr_mime` for the files that lack it |
|`metadata` |`true` |extract the embedded metadata of the files not yet read ([[Embedded metadata]]) |
|`refresh` |`true` |refresh the stat fields of what is still at its recorded path |

`202` with `{"task_id"}`, followed through the [[Task endpoints]]; `409` when a
reconcile is already active, `400` for a threshold out of range ([[Task kinds]],
[[Running a reconcile]]).
